starting with a planned Jaipur pilot.

4
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:24,980
Sahvo is currently in development
to give you more confidence on the road.

5
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:29,690
We have packed the essentials you need
into one new platform featuring

6
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:35,090
offline SOS, verified guides,
price transparency,

7
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:38,320
safety alerts, and multilingual support.

8
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:42,980
Whether you are navigating busy markets
or historic monuments,

9
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:47,290
you deserve clear answers
and practical safety support.

10
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:51,410
Visit sahvoapp.com and follow the journey

11
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:55,400
